      "message": "fix(ui): the Post dialog opens where the document last posted\n\nThe dialog opened with no folder and program.nc every time (#258, part\n1). It now starts in the folder of the document's last successful post\nwith that file's name, else beside the saved project as <project>.nc,\nfrom a pure rule the tests read (ui::post_file).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
